# The reviewed formal statements. A change here needs the owner's review and a
# matching update of STATEMENTS.lock, which CI checks. The lock also covers
# every project module that Spec.lean imports, transitively, and
# Proofs/AxiomAudit.lean, so a change to one of those fails CI until the owner
# approves a lock update.
/SPEC.md @soispoke
/Spec.lean @soispoke
/Spec/ @soispoke
/STATEMENTS.lock @soispoke

# What enforces the lock, the audit and the build.
/.github/ @soispoke
/tools/check_formal.py @soispoke
/Proofs/AxiomAudit.lean @soispoke
/lakefile.toml @soispoke
/lean-toolchain @soispoke
/lake-manifest.json @soispoke
